{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trial version description:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this demo, players can use one type of fighter jet, one type of frigate, one type of cruiser, and two types of flagship to form a fleet and complete the first 15 levels to experience the basic gameplay. The total process time for the trial version is about 1 to 2 hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starship Dice is a strategy game based on dice and inspired by mahjong. Players will use dice to command fleet battles, with different combinations of points and dice forming character designs. But don't worry, you can still engage in combat without forming a faction or even joining forces. Jump fleet, protect flagship, and eliminate all enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926460/extras/7eab8d86bf3db8297ec87e76889c5215.poster.avif?t=1759231644\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926460/extras/7eab8d86bf3db8297ec87e76889c5215.webm?t=1759231644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926460/extras/7eab8d86bf3db8297ec87e76889c5215.mp4?t=1759231644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926460/extras/a4ae2ae3eb8002070e5bdfdee4d2dac6.poster.avif?t=1759231644\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926460/extras/a4ae2ae3eb8002070e5bdfdee4d2dac6.webm?t=1759231644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926460/extras/a4ae2ae3eb8002070e5bdfdee4d2dac